      - Update CONTRIBUTING.md:10: it says CI only exercises Wukong and that
        browser smoke does not test a rendered frame or input, but ci/wasm-
        smoke.spec.mjs:3 checks canvas pixels, input, resize, blur, and hidden-
        tab behavior.

      - Add test-results/ and playwright-report/ to .gitignore:1. The
        Playwright run currently leaves an untracked test-results/.last-
        run.json.

      - Introduce a machine-readable support/evidence ledger, then generate
        SUPPORT.md from it. Each claim should include exact commit, OS, GPU/
        driver, browser, test type, and date. This is the most valuable
